# Build context for the ai-agent image (docker-compose: build ./ai-agent).
# The build stage runs `npm ci` and then `COPY . .`, so node_modules must stay
# excluded or the resolved dependency tree would be overwritten by the local one.
#
# NOTE: .dockerignore uses Go filepath.Match, not gitignore semantics. `**/`
# matches at any depth, including zero directories.

# Dependencies and build output
**/node_modules
dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Private lead data — consumer PII must never reach an image layer
**/Leads_Export_*.csv
**/*.local.csv
**/data/private
**/exports/private

# Test and coverage caches
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output

# Git metadata
.git
.gitignore

# OS junk and logs
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log
